e},{"campaign":"16V705000","received":"2016-10-03","manufacturer":"Kia Motors America","component":"POWER TRAIN:AXLE ASSEMBLY:AXLE SHAFT","summary":"Kia Motors America (Kia) is recalling certain model year 2016 Kia Optima vehicles manufactured November 13, 2015, to April 23, 2016 and equipped with a 2.4l engine.  The right front axle driveshaft may crack and fail.","consequence":"If the driveshaft cracks and separates from the vehicle, it will not be able to move forward.  Additionally, if the parking brake is not applied upon exiting the vehicle, the vehicle may roll.  Either scenario can increase the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Kia will notify owners, and dealers will replace the front axle driveshaft, free of charge.  The recall began November 2016.  Owners may contact Kia customer service at 1-800-333-4542.  Kia's number for this recall is SC139.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":12214,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=16V705000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":1,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2016","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"16V231000","received":"2016-04-21","manufacturer":"Kia Motors America","component":"AIR BAGS:FRONTAL","summary":"Kia Motors America (Kia) is recalling certain model year 2016 Kia Optima vehicles manufactured November 10, 2015, to February 12, 2016.  In these vehicles, a chemical enhancer required for the for the second stage deployment of the driver's frontal air bag was not loaded, resulting in the second stage not deploying in necessitating crashes.","consequence":"If the second stage air bag does not deploy it increases the risk of injury or death.","remedy":"Kia will notify owners, and dealers will replace the driver's frontal air bag module, free of charge.  The recall began on May 6, 2016.  Owners may contact Kia customer service at 1-800-333-4542.  Kia's number for this recall is SC131.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":17,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=16V231000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":1,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2016","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"23V594000","received":"2023-08-24","manufacturer":"Kia America, Inc.","component":"LATCHES/LOCKS/LINKAGES:TRUNK LID:LATCH","summary":"Kia America, Inc. (Kia) is recalling certain 2016-2017 Rio, 2016-2018 Optima, 2017-2018 Optima Hybrid and Optima Plug-in Hybrid vehicles.  The trunk latch base may crack, preventing the opening of the trunk from the inside.  As such, these vehicles fail to comply with the requirements of Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard number 401, \"Internal Trunk Release.\"","consequence":"A person inside the trunk compartment may become trapped, increasing their risk of injury.","remedy":"Dealers will replace the trunk latch base subassembly, free of charge.  Owner notification letters were mailed October 19, 2023.  Owners may contact Kia customer service at 1-800-333-4542.  Kia's number for this recall is SC278.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":319436,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=23V594000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":9,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2016","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA"},{"year":"2016","make":"KIA","model":"RIO"},{"year":"2017","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA HYBRID"},{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA HYBRID"},{"year":"2017","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA PHEV"},{"year":"2017","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA"},{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA"},{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"OPTIMA PHEV"},{"year":"2017","make":"KIA","model":"RIO"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
